+
+## Kernel imports
+
+`emit_prelink.py --kernel-import SYMBOL=ORIGINAL_VA[@NATIVE_VA]` binds a
+reference in the static kernel to a symbol in a selected donor component.
+`ORIGINAL_VA` is the component address in the donor; `NATIVE_VA` overrides the
+kernel-side symbol lookup (used by the offline probe). The emitter rewrites
+direct B/BL, ADRP+ADD and ADRP+LDR references, plus absolute 8-byte
+vtable/GOT/literal slots, to `ORIGINAL_VA + slide`. It refuses a request with no
+reference, an address outside the selected closure, or a B/BL outside the
+signed +/-128 MiB range. The result is still offline-only and not runtime
+qualified.
